#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:3
#: 447fcefd67824a74894ac4f245a031f4
msgid "Calibration"
msgstr "校准"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:5
#: 0b28969a68fb47559f3e5d103489b0bc
msgid ""
"There are several commands to calibrate the various sensors on the APM:"
msgstr "有若干命令可用于校准APM上的各种传感器："

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:8
#: 40087d1acad041c8a7a17b2af4672642
msgid "accelcal"
msgstr "accelcal"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:10
#: e3b922b3667740d081ea658e822b79cd
msgid ""
"Initiates the accelerometer calibration routines. This is the \"place the "
"UAV on its left side...\" routine."
msgstr "启动加速度计校准程序，即「将无人机放置在左侧……」的校准流程。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:14
#: a269997930d84b6aa9d96ea227716ad4
msgid "accelcalsimple"
msgstr "accelcalsimple"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:16
#: f565fd8e307a48f492d6c0edd9112eb1
msgid "Does a simple pre-flight accelerometer calibration"
msgstr "执行简单的飞前加速度计校准"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:19
#: 538a9e55d0154420b021602f76a2817d
msgid "gyrocal"
msgstr "gyrocal"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:21
#: a00d24cd3a494737b78eb8bbead1f1d3
msgid "Initiates the gyro calibration routines."
msgstr "启动陀螺仪校准程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:24
#: 5ec2736108f944a18a95d129be9b28d8
msgid "calpress"
msgstr "calpress"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:26
#: 5462b2449d294894a60f3825d10636a4
msgid "Initiates the pressure sensor calibration routines."
msgstr "启动气压传感器校准程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:29
#: 0383ff2fec0c4af882d7a72cb77ef3a2
msgid "compassmot"
msgstr "compassmot"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:31
#: 81ffbb3e65ba4c598d145e2e96ecde4f
msgid "Initiates the magnetometer/motor interference calibration routines."
msgstr "启动磁力计/电机干扰校准程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:34
#: c0566b1960d14b6ea5f2a32bb86a3a83
msgid "level"
msgstr "level"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:36
#: acaa360f15de48a4a6e5b58d379d52bf
msgid "Do a levelling routine on a multicopter."
msgstr "对多旋翼飞行器执行水平校准程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:39
#: 482a9a615b07465692e62a16353538ac
msgid "rccal"
msgstr "rccal"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:41
#: 7ba25f267c4e44e99b2f1c7fa2c0b6c9
msgid "Perform calibration of the RC input channels."
msgstr "执行RC输入通道校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:44
#: 326146137c8e4bde8562fd6649ee4d61
msgid "ground"
msgstr "ground"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:46
#: 0a9c5c1a27844b1f9e15a9e84bc95553
msgid ""
"Performs a full ground start. This includes gyro and pressure sensor "
"calibration. It is automatically performed when the autopilot receives an "
"arming command."
msgstr "执行完整的地面启动流程，包括陀螺仪和气压传感器校准。飞控接收到加锁命令时会自动执行此流程。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:51
#: b34464a7448e42a59622a72001b5e02d
msgid "magcal"
msgstr "magcal"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:53
#: cd0ae172d603497684ce120089101ed4
msgid ""
"Magnetometer (compass) calibration to account for any soft-iron sources on "
"the UAV."
msgstr "磁力计（罗盘）校准，用于补偿无人机上的软铁干扰源。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:57
#: d3db4b0844904afb9d0e6c7fb674f883
msgid "ahrstrim"
msgstr "ahrstrim"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/calibration.rst:59
#: 027e052fad7149d29df3c2c604e821ac
msgid "Do a AHRS trim."
msgstr "执行AHRS配平。"
